msgid ""
"Specific people to notify when this event occurs. You can add multiple recipients.\n"
"Important:\n"
"• For System Chat: Recipients must have an Odoo user account\n"
"• For Email: Recipients must have an email address\n"
"• For SMS: Recipients must have a mobile phone number"
msgstr ""
"Persone specifiche da notificare quando si verifica questo evento. È possibile aggiungere più destinatari.\n"
