#. module: hr_rfid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid.field_hr_rfid_ctrl_ts_line__begin
msgid ""
"Start time for this access period. Enter in 24-hour format (e.g., 8.5 for "
"8:30 AM, 17.25 for 5:15 PM). Leave at 0:00 if this interval is not used."
